From 96ea000f2fddd5102212f69f5009bda1e36601d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Tue, 17 Mar 2026 23:16:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/12] Add system property overrides for status bar and corner
 geometry

Allow overriding status bar padding (start, end, top, bottom),
Quick Settings header rounded corner padding, and display rounded
corner radii via persist.sys.phh.* system properties.

These properties let users correct UI geometry issues on devices
where the vendor display cutout or corner radius metadata does not
match the actual hardware, without requiring per-device overlays.

Properties:
- persist.sys.phh.rounded_corners_padding: override content inset
  padding and rounded corner radius (set to >= 0 to enable)
- persist.sys.phh.status_bar_padding_{start,end,top,bottom}:
  override status bar content padding on each edge
